                               ***History***
                                

                Changes Shadow's Edge Die Roller V1.3   10/15/96

	Added in the Routine to Check for Loss of Carrier, Should work
flawlessly (Knock On Wood!)  Cleaned up the Code a little, though i admit it is
still quite messy, But hey, it's my first program!


                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V1.2   9/21/96

	The log displays each Individual die rolled and a total for the roll.
Inserted a pause after each roll in the log, More still not functioning.

                              
                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V1.1   9/17/96

	Shortened part of the random code, Fixes a few errors encountered with
some Users.  It is also quicker without sacrificing any of the randomness.


                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V1.0   9/9/96 

        Redrew the ANSI menu, and it now displays from within the program,
instead of calling an external file.  Set the Log to group Multi die rolls 
together.  fixed a small Bug in the "How many times would you like to roll"
prompt, program no longer aborts if the user hits return.  Generally cleaned up
and condensed the script file (It was very messy!)


                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V0.8   9/8/96

        Implemented a constantly changing Variable in the random Number 
generation.  Now The roller is Much More random, With no traceable patterns
What-so-ever (unlike Before).  Maintenance Access level is now Sysop Definable.
Program now has the option to change muffle settings upon entering, And 
will automatically UnMuffle at exit.  Improved Log Maintenance: Maint is now
SysOp definable by access group, bug fixed in that the Log is now fully reset 
after clear, and added the option to edit the log file with your default
 editor on the log right out of the program.


                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V0.75  9/8/96

        The Multi roll now displays Individual dice instead of the Lump sum, 
i.e. "Roll 3 6 sided dice" will now show the Numbers 4,2, & 6, instead of 12.


                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V0.7   9/7/96

        Added a Multi Roll feature, Program now lets you select how many times
you'd like to roll the specified die.  Doesn't show each Die, Just the Lump 
sum.  Writes the result, die size and # of times rolled to the OutPut File.

  
                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V0.6   9/7/96

        Simply added a sysop only option to clear the Rolls.dat file.  This is
actually reserved for account #1 (presumably the SysOp.)  There is one bug
in that after you clear the log file if you try to go back in and view it, it
will tell you it cannot find rolls.dat.  You need to quit the program and then
reenter and all will work fine.


                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V0.5   9/7/96

        The die roller now saves all files to a text File named rolls.dat,
which will record the Day, date and time of the roll, the users handle, the
result of the roll, and the size die the user rolled.  Also added a Main menu,
where the user can select to roll, view previous rolls, or quit the Program.


                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V0.25  9/6/96

        Shortened some of the code for the actual random # generation.  Now
all dice use the same label to generate #'s, instead of each die having it's 
own label.  Implemented Full error processing, now sends a message on Syntax,
Error, & Ioerr, and then exists.  Also generally cleaned up the script.

 
                Changes Shadow's EdGe Die Roller V0.1   9/6/96

        Original Version.  Very Sloppy.  simply asked what size die to roll. 
